---
// 연구 (/[lang]/research). Scope / Themes / Projects 세 섹션. 헤더 하위 메뉴가 앵커로 연결된다.
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/base-layout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../../components/page-header.astro";
import Section from "../../components/section.astro";
import EmptyState from "../../components/empty-state.astro";
import PublicationItem from "../../components/publication-item.astro";
import {
  researchAreas,
  researchProjects,
  publications,
  splitResearch,
  localizedText,
} from "../../lib/content";
import {
  localePaths,
  useTranslations,
  withLocale,
  type Locale,
} from "../../i18n/utils";
import { collectionLabel } from "../../config/collections";
import { groupProjects } from "../../lib/projects";

export const getStaticPaths = localePaths;

const lang = Astro.params.lang as Locale;
const t = useTranslations(lang);

// Notion Research DB 한 곳에 Scope(연구 범위)와 Theme(세부 주제)이 같이 들어 있다.
// 한쪽이 0건이어도 레이아웃이 깨지지 않도록 각각 따로 렌더한다.
const { scopes, themes } = splitResearch(researchAreas);

const scopeItems = scopes
  .map((s) => ({ id: s.id, body: localizedText(s, "summary", lang) }))
  .filter((s) => s.body);

const areas = themes
  .map((a) => ({
    id: a.id,
    title: localizedText(a, "title", lang),
    summary: localizedText(a, "summary", lang),
  }))
  .filter((a) => a.title);

const scope = scopeItems[0]?.body ?? null; // meta description 용

// 연구 분야와 논문의 관계를 화면에서 잇는다 — 최근 5건만 보여주고 전체는 링크로.
// year 는 null 일 수 있으므로("연도 미상") 0 으로 보아 맨 뒤로 보낸다.
const recentPublications = [...publications]
  .sort((a, b) => (b.year ?? 0) - (a.year ?? 0))
  .slice(0, 5);

// 과제는 먼저 "진행 중" + 시작 연도로 묶고(lib/projects.ts), 그룹 안에서 언어를 적용한다.
// 제목이 양쪽 언어 모두 비어 항목이 전부 걸러진 그룹은 제목만 남지 않도록 함께 버린다.
const projectGroups = groupProjects(researchProjects)
  .map((g) => ({
    ongoing: g.ongoing,
    year: g.year,
    items: g.items
      .map((p) => ({
        id: p.id,
        title: localizedText(p, "title", lang),
        period: p.period,
        funder: localizedText(p, "funder", lang),
      }))
      .filter((p) => p.title),
  }))
  .filter((g) => g.items.length > 0);
---

<BaseLayout lang={lang} title={t("nav.research")} description={scope ?? undefined}>
  <PageHeader title={t("nav.research")} lede={t("research.lede")} />

  <Section id="scope" title={t("nav.research.scope")}>
    {scopeItems.length === 0 && <EmptyState lang={lang} />}
    <div class="flex max-w-3xl flex-col gap-4">
      {
        scopeItems.map((s) => (
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink">{s.body}</p>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section id="themes" title={collectionLabel("research", lang)} muted>
    {areas.length === 0 && <EmptyState lang={lang} />}
    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {
        areas.map((a) => (
          <article class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-5">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">{a.title}</h3>
            {a.summary && (
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink">{a.summary}</p>
            )}
          </article>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section id="projects" title={collectionLabel("projects", lang)}>
    {projectGroups.length === 0 && <EmptyState lang={lang} />}
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
      {
        projectGroups.map((g) => (
          <div>
            {/* 섹션 제목이 h2 이므로 그룹 제목은 h3 (헤딩 순서 유지) */}
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-muted tabular-nums">
              {g.ongoing ? t("research.projectsOngoing") : g.year}
            </h3>
            <ul class="flex flex-col divide-y divide-line border-y border-line">
              {g.items.map((p) => (
                <li class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">
                  <span class="font-medium text-ink">{p.title}</span>
                  <span class="shrink-0 text-sm text-ink-muted">
                    {p.funder ? `${t("research.projectFunder")}: ${p.funder} · ` : ""}
                    {p.period}
                  </span>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </Section>

  {
    recentPublications.length > 0 && (
      <Section id="publications" title={collectionLabel("publications", lang)} muted>
        <a
          slot="cta"
          href={withLocale(lang, "/research/publications")}
          aria-label={`${t("common.viewAll")} — ${collectionLabel("publications", lang)}`}
          class="shrink-0 text-sm font-medium text-brand hover:underline"
        >
          {t("common.viewAll")} →
        </a>
        <div class="divide-y divide-line border-y border-line">
          {recentPublications.map((p) => (
            <PublicationItem publication={p} lang={lang} />
          ))}
        </div>
      </Section>
    )
  }
</BaseLayout>
